          "canonical_id": "huggingface:intfloat/multilingual-e5-small",
          "name": "multilingual-e5-small",
          "url": "https://huggingface.co/intfloat/multilingual-e5-small",
          "summary_short": {
            "zh": "Multilingual-E5-small 是一个多语言句子嵌入模型，能将100多种语言的文本转换为语义向量，解决跨语言语义匹配的难题。它基于BERT架构，但通过对比学习专门优化，能在不依赖翻译的情况下理解不同语言间的语义关联。该模型的核心优势在于其多语言泛化能力，即使训练数据有限的语种也能获得不错的嵌入质量。开发者可用它构建跨语言搜索引擎、对多语言文档进行智能聚类，或为问答系统提供更好的多语言检索支持，特别适合处理全球化内容的应用场景。",
            "en": "Multilingual-E5-small is a compact sentence embedding model that converts text in over 100 languages into meaningful numerical representations for semantic similarity tasks. It builds on BERT architecture but is specifically trained with contrastive learning to excel at multilin…",
            "es": "Multilingual-E5-small is a compact sentence embedding model that converts text in over 100 languages into meaningful numerical representations for semantic similarity tasks. It builds on BERT architecture but is specifically trained with contrastive learning to excel at multilin…"
          },
